# Tosca migration → Playwright tests

**Post-migration readability:** **`§ 22`** in **`AGENT_BRAIN.md`** — **`tests/migrated/{module,testcase,library}/`**, **`npm run scaffold:migrated-stubs`** then **`npm run generate:tosca-tests`**, **`MIGRATED_PLAYWRIGHT_LAYOUT=1`** (**scaffold → generate** in **`migrate:pipeline`**).

Quick reminders when editing **`tests/tosca-*.spec.ts`** or **`fixtures/**`**:

1. Prefer **`migrate:pipeline`** (**`§ 5`**) after export changes.
2. JSONL harness: **`tosca-testcases-from-migration.spec.ts`** (**`§ 12`**) vs optional **`npm run generate:tosca-tests`**.
3. Merged literals: **`getMergedLiteralsForPlaywright`**, **`getPlaceholderResolutionContext`**, **`loadToscaFullMigration`**.
4. **`AGENT_STRICT=1`** with **`npm run agent:migration`** (**`§ 12`**).

If this rule and **`AGENT_BRAIN.md`** disagree, **`AGENT_BRAIN.md`** wins unless **§ 16 Exceptions** states otherwise — then reconcile this stub.

